==Icthlarin's shrouds==
Icthlarin's shrouds are a set of capes received by completing certain amounts of the [[Tombs of Amascut]]:
* {{plink|Icthlarin's shroud (tier 1)}} – 100 raids
* {{plink|Icthlarin's shroud (tier 2)}} – 500 raids
* {{plink|Icthlarin's shroud (tier 3)}} – 1000 raids
* {{plink|Icthlarin's shroud (tier 4)}} – 1500 raids
* {{plink|Icthlarin's shroud (tier 5)}} – 2000 raids

==Sinhaza shrouds==
Sinhaza shrouds are a set of capes received from the [[Mysterious Stranger]] by completing certain amounts of the [[Theatre of Blood]]:
*{{plink|Sinhaza shroud tier 1}} – 100 raids
*{{plink|Sinhaza shroud tier 2}} – 500 raids
*{{plink|Sinhaza shroud tier 3}} – 1000 raids
*{{plink|Sinhaza shroud tier 4}} – 1500 raids
*{{plink|Sinhaza shroud tier 5}} – 2000 raids

